WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.370
Someone once said:

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:06.670
There is powdered snow which, when melted,

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:09.470
turns into rich, deep flavored cocoa.

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:13.610
Cocoa Powdered Snow!

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:22.390
There are lobsters whose 
meat has an entrancing,

00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:25.620
many-colored sparkle like a pearl,

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:28.660
whose shine continues on for 
a time even inside the mouth!

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:32.000
The Pearlobster!

00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:36.670
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:42.010
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.750
Entrance to the Regal Highlands - Regal Wall

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.750
Regal Highlands

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.750
Devils' Playground

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.750
White Forest

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.750
Black Carpet

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.750
Mushroom Wood

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.750
Ancient Marsh

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.750
No. 1 Gourmet Laboratory

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:51.550
On their way to the Regal Highlands, Toriko 
and Rin faced their biggest challenge,

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:53.990
getting through the Devils' Playground.

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:57.020
After reuniting with Terry and Tina,

00:02:57.020 --> 00:03:00.020
they successfully slipped through 
and out of the Devils' Playground.

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:05.800
Then, Terry stayed behind 
to stop Starjun's GT Robot,

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:08.630
while Toriko and the others hurried ahead.

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:10.570
Devils' Playground

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:13.340
At the same time, a giant 
Regal Mammoth is falling down

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:16.610
on Sunny and Komatsu as they 
are climbing the Regal Wall!

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:25.250
The Ultimate Backup! 
Clash, Coco vs. GT Robot!

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.590
What the heck is that?!

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:49.340
That Regal Mammoth is huge!

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:52.040
It's slipped and fallen off the cliff!

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:53.310
This doesn't make any sense!

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:54.980
This is too amazing!

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:57.150
That's an adult mammoth!

00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:58.450
No doubt about it!

00:03:58.450 --> 00:03:59.280
Let's hurry!

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:00.150
Yeah!

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.190
Wait!

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:04.360
It's dangerous, so don't come with us!

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:05.420
You're in the way!

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:06.820
You've got to be kidding me!

00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:09.190
I'd rather go without supper

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:11.730
than let a super-sized 
scoop like this pass me by!

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:16.330
This isn't good!

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:18.870
Sunny-san, do something!

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:22.140
Pick it up like you did with 
that young mammoth before!

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:22.910
Not a chance!

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:24.840
That's completely impossible!

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:31.420
Could we escape into the Heavy Cliff's nest?

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:36.150
There's a whole bunch of 'em now!

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:40.490
Do they look kind of angry to you?

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:43.390
That's not a good thing, is it?

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:50.130
They don't think this disturbance 
is our fault... do they?

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:51.200
Yes?

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:54.470
This wasn't part of the plan!

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:56.670
We're in trouble, Matsu!

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:57.480
There's too many!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.740
We're going for a brief detour!

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:01.410
Let's get out of here, Sunny-sa...

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:04.080
Run!!

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:05.480
Run?

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:06.990
Spatula!

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:13.090
I don't do unseemly things 
like "running away".

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:14.590
I am simply briefly drawing back.

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:17.560
But drawing back at max speed!

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:22.770
That's...

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:24.440
Komatsu, Sunny!

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:25.840
Brother?

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:27.570
Toriko and Rin!

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.010
Toriko-san!

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:30.780
Toriko-san!

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:32.380
You're alive, I see?

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:34.950
And can you do something 
about this situation?!

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:36.650
Do something?

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:38.820
Toriko, we're going to be 
in trouble here ourselves!

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:40.080
Stand back!

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:42.090
Knife!

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:54.100
Sunny, jump... in here!

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:02.570
Right! Here we go, Matsu!

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:04.280
Okay!

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:08.080
This hole is deep!

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.020
Brother!

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:50.290
Regal Mammoth (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 48

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:04.670
My Hair Net was just barely enough.

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:08.010
It was compressed that far, 
but I managed to stick it out.

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:09.610
That was close...

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:12.010
Toriko-san!

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:14.380
Komatsu, I'm so glad you're safe!

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:16.250
It was all thanks to Sunny-san!

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.150
Hey, you look completely worn out!

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:19.450
What happened to you, Toriko?

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.690
Those are Cream Mushrooms, right?

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:24.660
Is it okay if I eat them, Komatsu?

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:27.260
Uh, sure. Just wait a moment.

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:28.030
They're not even listening to me.

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:39.270
That's a Regal Mammoth!

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.970
What incredible size!

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:43.370
It's totally different than the baby mammoth!

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:45.510
Why did it fall?

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:49.780
I bet it came down the cliff 
searching for the child.

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:53.220
Although it looks more like it <i>fell</i> down...

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:05.500
You still haven't extracted it?

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:09.670
Hurry up or the Knocking will wear off again!

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:12.770
My apologies. The analysis 
will be completed shortly.

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:17.010
The inside of a Regal Mammoth is like a maze.

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:21.010
It's difficult to find the 
Jewel Meat even inside a child.

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:23.720
Chief, it seems like Toriko and the others

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:25.750
have successfully made contact 
with a Regal Mammoth.

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:30.050
However, they have sustained a lot of 
damage, and are facing a hard situation.

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:32.060
Did you just say handsome!?

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:34.460
No. I did not say anything like that at all.

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:37.200
He's heading toward them.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.030
I bet he'll be arriving any time now.

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:41.300
But, what'll we do?

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:44.570
My feelers and Knocking won't 
work on something this big.

00:08:48.740 --> 00:08:49.670
What the...

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.310
Heavy Cliffs!

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:53.280
Those beasts...

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:55.750
They turned their bodies 
into balls and hardened,

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:59.480
to protect themselves the 
moment the Regal Mammoth fell.

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:08.760
Spatula!

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:11.230
Knife!

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:14.200
T-That's hard!

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.940
I've got no strength since 
I haven't eaten anything!

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:25.310
Why, you...

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:35.190
I didn't kill them.

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:37.960
It's poison to paralyze their entire body!

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:44.660
Coco!

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:47.370
Hey. Looks like I was late.

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:01.150
Looks like I was late.

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:06.780
Coco-san!

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:08.690
Coco-swan!

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:10.690
Hey, Komatsu-kun. Long time no see.

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:13.060
Coco-san, Coco-san, Coco-swan!

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:15.590
Seeing you in as dangerous a place as this,

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:19.030
it looks like you don't 
learn, do you, Komatsu-kun?

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:20.230
Coco-san!

00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:23.000
Those sharp words are so you, Coco-san!

00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:24.500
Coco!

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:25.640
Coco!

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:27.640
Rin-chan, how has it been?

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:29.740
Viewers, please take a look at this!

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:31.880
Three of the Four Heavenly 
Kings are assembled together!

00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:33.210
Oh, that's right.

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:35.850
I'm sorry... You don't like cameras, right?

00:10:35.850 --> 00:10:38.120
I won't point it towards 
you another gram, okay?

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:39.020
Sorry about that.

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:40.490
Oh, it's nothing.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:45.390
W-What a beautiful entrance!

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:47.460
He totally took the juiciest part!

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:50.090
Unbelievably beautiful timing!

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:52.400
So beautiful, it's actually...

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:53.700
...really pissing me off!

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:54.900
Oh, Sunny.

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:57.040
What's wrong? You're not 
extending your feelers.

00:10:57.040 --> 00:10:59.700
It's been a while, so... handshake?

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:03.940
Sunny-san... Your feelers 
aren't extended right now?

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:05.440
Yeah, he's not putting them out.

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:08.510
Coco can also see Sunny's feelers.

00:11:08.510 --> 00:11:12.780
More precisely, I can see the minute 
electromagnetic waves emitted from them.

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:14.190
It's just...

00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:17.990
...I don't want to touch you. That's why.

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:20.060
I mean, you're poisonous, see?

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:23.230
M-Man, he doesn't beat around the bush.

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:26.660
The Heavy Cliffs!

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:33.500
Look. Even so angry, the Heavy 
Cliffs are being cautious.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:36.770
Their instincts have sensed danger.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:40.240
Damn... Is he the only one that 
we can't do anything about?

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:49.390
It's okay.

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:54.260
I've already made my move.

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:58.360
What?

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:01.400
But, with a body that large...

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:07.210
...it'll take a while to fully circulate.

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:09.110
After that, it shouldn't be able to move.

00:12:09.110 --> 00:12:10.710
You already poisoned it!

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:11.980
Impressive!

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:13.880
Bravo, Coco-swan!

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:18.050
However, the problem is inside its body.

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:22.520
I can see different EM waves inside its body.

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:25.720
The Gourmet Corp. has already infiltrated.

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:26.920
Inside of it?

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:28.190
Look at the size!

00:12:28.190 --> 00:12:30.190
I bet they gave up trying to kill it.

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:34.170
So they went inside to get 
the Jewel Meat directly.

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:36.730
That's just the type of lowbrow,

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.940
disgusting thing the Gourmet 
Corp. would consider.

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:44.480
J-Jewel Meat...

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:46.840
It's right there in front of us...

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:49.980
Meat said to shine with 
an overwhelming sparkle,

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:53.350
looking like countless jewels!

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:56.420
A market price of 5 million 
yen for 100 grams!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:13:00.220
An ancient food treasure which embodies 
the flavors of every cut of meat!

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.560
I want to see it, even if just once!

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:05.000
I want to taste it!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:07.330
And if possible, I want to bring 
some back for my restaurant!

00:13:07.330 --> 00:13:09.900
And I want to film this super-sized scoop!

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:11.770
And eat it!

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:13.940
You also want to eat it, Kuruppo?

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:15.840
This is a battle against time.

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:18.410
We'll head inside.

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:20.240
'Kay!

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:21.950
Then, me too!

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:23.920
That's impossible, not a chance!

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:25.350
No, it is possible.

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:26.720
Right, let's go!

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.420
We've got to hurry!

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:30.020
I'll come with you!

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:33.260
Let's all go inside together, Sunny-san!

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:35.230
You expect me to go inside 
of a place that icky?

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:37.130
I suppose from this place,

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:39.030
it would be safest to enter from the butt.

00:13:39.030 --> 00:13:40.700
You're joking, right?

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:41.970
I'm not going!

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:44.100
Watch out!

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:47.810
Toriko-san!

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:48.710
Brother!

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:55.850
G-GT Robot!

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:56.780
It...

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:57.750
It's huge!

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:04.160
I heard they had a new model.

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:06.360
But not that it was so big.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:08.890
The Gourmet World advances by the day.

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:12.100
It looks like I really have been 
out of the game for a while.

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:21.940
So that footprint was from this guy?

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:26.040
This guy's high level. Watch yourself, Coco.

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:27.080
I know.

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:30.450
High enough for the EM waves of the 
operator to be transmitted through...

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:32.880
However, it shouldn't be a problem.

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:36.790
Yeah. As long as it wasn't 
the one from the cavern...

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:36.810
This's some good luck!

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:39.550
Look at all the famous people 
I've got gathered here!

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:43.620
Won't wiping you out be a bigger 
accomplishment than getting the Jewel Meat?

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:49.430
Oh? Who's going to be 
wiping who out, exactly?

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:50.660
You peon!

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:52.600
Sunny, I'll handle this.

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:53.500
Coco!

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:55.730
Everyone else hurry and find the Jewel Meat.

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:57.470
We're in trouble if they get it first.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:58.200
Plus...

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:01.870
I realized when I saw Toriko...

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:04.580
But everyone is far more 
exhausted than I thought.

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:08.050
The reason your feelers aren't out 
has nothing to do with my poison.

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:09.480
Isn't that right, Sunny?

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:13.180
And I tried really hard to calmly hide it.

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:16.420
Anyway, I'll hold this guy off!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:19.690
You'll all be dying here!

00:16:19.690 --> 00:16:20.960
Kiss!

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:33.910
Now, everyone! Go!

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:35.970
Thank you, Coco!

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:37.810
You really saved our bacon!

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:39.610
Brother, let's go!

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:41.010
Sunny-san, hurry!

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:42.250
I know, I know!

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:52.420
You bastard...

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:54.630
I won't let you die so easily any more.

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:56.460
Are you talking about yourself?

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:57.500
What?

00:16:57.860 --> 00:17:00.500
I can see the shadow of death on you.

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:04.740
Shadow of death?

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:06.070
Don't make me laugh.

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:08.740
A robot with the shadow of 
death? That's hilarious!

00:17:08.740 --> 00:17:11.080
No, I mean you, the operator.

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:13.040
Since you're so high level, see.

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:13.850
That's right.

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:18.450
You, the operator, are projecting 
your shadow of death to me.

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:26.120
Joe Joe!

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:27.060
Joe Joe!

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:28.630
Get Gido down here, now!

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:30.960
I'll cut that bastard to shreds!

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:34.370
Putting on a brave face after 
leaving the battle, Zyper?

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:38.100
If he hadn't stepped on me, 
I'd have regenerated, damn it!

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:41.540
He's all full of himself 
in that giant GT Robot!

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:45.010
That's because no one except 
Gido could pilot it.

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:49.610
The "Giant Model" was invented 
to face extremely large beasts.

00:17:49.610 --> 00:17:52.120
Because of the effects 
of gravity on the body,

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:55.920
operating it is more difficult than anything 
except the micro version we're developing now.

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:58.690
And he's in battle right now.

00:17:58.690 --> 00:17:59.860
Battle?

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:01.630
Not with the mammoth, I presume.

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:04.300
Even the Giant GT Robot is no match for it.

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:08.770
No. The enemy is one of the 
Four Heavenly Kings, Coco.

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:09.900
Coco?

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:12.870
The one said to have immunity 
to countless poisons

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:14.510
and can produce poison in his own body...

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:17.810
In the flesh, there would 
be no chance to win.

00:18:17.810 --> 00:18:21.680
But the GT Robot, having cleared a test 
swimming in the currents of death,

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:24.780
the Poison Tide, should 
have a good chance to win.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:29.350
One way or the other, we will win this time.

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:32.120
Cedre-sama is already inside the mammoth.

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:35.590
Furthermore, Starjun-sama 
has gone there himself.

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:36.390
What?

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:37.900
Starjun-sama is...

00:18:56.850 --> 00:18:59.420
And where can we get inside?

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:00.550
I-I dunno...

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:02.020
Can't be the nose.

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:03.890
It'll eat us and spit out the bones.

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:04.820
What'll we do?

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:07.430
I think it's... gotta be the butt!

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:10.030
Are you crazy?

00:19:10.030 --> 00:19:10.960
Understood.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:11.960
Let's go!

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:12.900
We'll go!

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:13.830
No way!

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:15.130
Absolutely, positively, not a chance!

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:16.170
No way, no chance!

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:18.000
In that case I'm going home!

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:24.180
Shoot!

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.980
The poison still hasn't completely...

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:28.950
No...

00:19:29.550 --> 00:19:32.380
I can see the shadow of 
death around one of them...

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:34.520
Kiss!

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:39.160
Hey now, hey now!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:45.660
I saw the shadow of death...

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:47.500
Sunny!

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:49.100
Is there some way to stop it?

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:49.930
I can't!

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:51.570
It's got incredible power!

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:59.340
Spiked Punch!

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:07.290
Everyone!

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:10.560
This is no time for you to look away!

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:19.460
How do you like my cooking fire?

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:21.170
Don't kick the bucket yet!

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:23.330
That was just a little prep work.

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:26.000
After this, I'll cook you nice and slow...

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:30.480
That level of flame is how 
you prepare your ingredients?

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:32.640
Your cooking is quite cheap, I see.

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:35.080
Poison Skin.

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:38.620
I covered my skin with a thin 
layer of poison to protect it.

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:42.020
This time, I'll cook you!

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:44.990
And I'll use a little 
seasoning called poison!

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:47.130
Bring it on.

00:20:54.570 --> 00:20:55.970
That hurt!

00:20:55.970 --> 00:20:57.140
You okay?

00:20:57.440 --> 00:20:59.470
Yeah... I'm fine!

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:02.340
We've been eaten, Toriko-san!

00:21:02.340 --> 00:21:03.980
What'll we do?

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:05.280
Don't freak out.

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:09.580
The inside of the mammoth's mouth is 
wide open, and we have air to breathe.

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:12.280
In this case, its giant size is a blessing.

00:21:12.550 --> 00:21:13.450
Sure...

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:16.120
Okay, we're heading into the body!

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:20.190
Toriko-san, aren't we...

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:24.000
...on top of a tooth?!

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:47.090
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:47.650 --> 00:21:53.360
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:54.130 --> 00:22:00.670
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:22:01.070 --> 00:22:05.540
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:10.680
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:22:10.680 --> 00:22:14.050
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:14.050 --> 00:22:18.520
on a journey with no end!

00:22:20.390 --> 00:22:23.450
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:23.450 --> 00:22:26.620
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:26.620 --> 00:22:32.600
amid the waves of time.

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:37.540
Gourmet News!

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:40.240
I'm your host, Tina.

00:22:40.240 --> 00:22:43.210
This time I'll be introducing 
the Heavy Cliff.

00:22:40.870 --> 00:22:52.820
Heavy Cliff (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 30

00:22:43.470 --> 00:22:47.150
Heavy Cliffs often jump down from cliffs,

00:22:47.150 --> 00:22:49.150
so their body's hardness is strengthened.

00:22:49.150 --> 00:22:53.120
It seems like their Capture 
Level gradually rises.

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:56.290
There are very few people 
who have eaten their meat,

00:22:56.290 --> 00:22:59.820
but the rumors are it's 
unexpectedly soft and sweet,

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:02.130
like a marshmallow!

00:23:02.430 --> 00:23:04.400
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:08.380
Poison may be scary...

00:23:08.380 --> 00:23:11.390
But, it's poison that's saving us!

00:23:11.390 --> 00:23:13.230
Show us your poison, Coco!

00:23:13.790 --> 00:23:17.010
The Threat of Deadly Poison! 
Coco's Formula for Victory!

00:23:17.370 --> 00:23:19.380
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
